"{\"edits\":[{\"start\":0,\"end\":1,\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For January 8, 2027, J63 and J75 tie for earliest arrival among the shown award itineraries, reaching Bangkok at 4:15 a.m. January 10. J63 leaves SFO four minutes earlier; J75 has a one-minute shorter LAX wait and four minutes less reported elapsed time. Both use 275,000 Turkish miles and show a USD 59 positioning fare, but award taxes and fare scope are unknown, so neither total cost is established. The results treat the positioning flight and award as separate-ticket components; protection and bookability are unverified. Search results are partial, and these are selected examples—not all available options.\"}]},{\"start\":1,\"end\":2,\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J63@2027-01-08T08:36-08:00/SFO>BKK/B>2027-01-10T04:15\",\"n\":\"Business award tied for earliest arrival\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO at 8:36 a.m. on January 8 and arrives in Bangkok at 4:15 a.m. January 10. The award portion is Turkish business class from LAX via IST, using 275,000 Turkish miles; the SFO–LAX positioning flight is American, with a quoted USD 59 fare. The LAX wait before the award flight is 150 minutes. The results treat the positioning flight and award as separate-ticket components, and protection or bookability is unverified. Award seats are unknown, taxes and fees are unavailable, and the reported business cabin does not establish the cabin on every leg.\"}]}]}"
